      "writtenOn": "2018-12-17T23:12:15Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "this +1 and -1 everywhere is very troublesome. This would be incredible easy to miss someplace.\n\nLet\u0027s please from the + 1 handle; it just adds potential for bugs at this point without giving us anything (because we are assuming the encoding everywhere)\n\n----\n\nif size_in_bits were a constant this would be a nice bit shift operation instead of a divide. (it probably should be a constant)",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 456,
        "startChar": 29,
        "endLine": 456,
        "endChar": 50
      },
      "revId": "e61da9ce473d700e985937a561084b72f39b1b26",
